    <string name="onboarding_welcome_note_content"># Start here\n\nSave something useful first: a link, a voice thought, or a quick text note. You do not need to organize it yet.\n\nLater, open a note and tap the lightning button. ChillScript shows an AI preview before anything gets inserted or replaced.\n\nOnce you have a few notes, select them on the home screen and use **Create from Notes** to shape them into an idea, post, or script.\n\nKeep it simple: capture first, create when you are ready.</string>
